  "overview": "It is an action film directed and stared by Wayne Crawford. Two Los Angeles cops, an aging slob (Wayne Crawford) and his cocky young partner (Martin Hewitt), are suspended from duty after inciting an incident at a chop shop. The two decide to track down the owner (James Hong), and follow him all the way to a Hong Kong crime ring. 这是一部由韦恩·克劳福德自导自演的动作片。讲述了两名警员在进行一项普通的日常调查时，卷入一个庞大的国际性汽车走私圈套……",
